    "group": "Norn Assimilator",
    "summary": "As the first battle round begins, choose one option. Either pick an enemy unit: from then until the battle ends, this model may re-roll both the [Hit roll](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) and the [Wound roll](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls) for its attacks against that unit. Or pick an objective marker: from then until the battle ends, while this model is in that marker's range it has [Feel No Pain 5+](vsdata:core-ability/feel-no-pain) and its [Objective Control](vsdata:core-rule/level-of-control) characteristic is 15.",
